WEBVTT

00:06.030 --> 00:08.430
That meeting was way too long!

00:09.980 --> 00:12.440
My stomach almost grumbled!

00:12.440 --> 00:14.530
Fukuzawa, yours definitely did.

00:15.310 --> 00:16.660
Did you hear it?

00:17.020 --> 00:18.700
Sorry.

00:19.300 --> 00:20.660
<i>I mean...</i>

00:21.020 --> 00:23.700
<i>I kept thinking about 
the lunch box waiting for me!</i>

00:23.700 --> 00:25.670
<i>Today's Yukichi special.</i>

00:25.960 --> 00:27.870
Thank you for the meal!

00:32.170 --> 00:33.410
Wh-What?

00:33.410 --> 00:36.460
Are you trying to show off your homemaking 
skills with your lunch boxes, Fukuzawa?

00:37.240 --> 00:40.760
Maybe you're aiming for a super 
high-spec marriage partner?

00:40.760 --> 00:42.930
Once again, your lunch looks amazing.

00:42.930 --> 00:45.660
No, no, no! Not at all!

00:45.660 --> 00:48.120
So you're really making 
lunches like that for fun?

00:48.120 --> 00:50.640
But you want to get married, right?

00:52.200 --> 00:54.050
Marriage?

00:55.760 --> 00:59.240
That's the face of someone who 
isn't thinking about things at all..

00:59.240 --> 01:02.920
You're going to miss your chance if you keep 
picking at your lunch without thinking about things.

01:02.920 --> 01:06.280
How was that singles party you went to?

01:06.280 --> 01:11.180
Actually, my friends and I ended up 
going to a city-sponsored singles event.

01:11.490 --> 01:12.790
How'd it go?!

01:12.790 --> 01:13.630
Well...

01:14.780 --> 01:16.360
<i>Marriage?</i>

01:20.630 --> 01:22.970
As incompetent as I am...

01:38.820 --> 01:45.960
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

02:53.020 --> 02:56.690
Can

02:53.020 --> 02:56.690
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Able to DIY</b>

02:56.820 --> 02:58.030
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Able to DIY</b>

02:56.900 --> 02:58.030
Can

03:01.700 --> 03:03.560
<i>Marriage?</i>

03:05.380 --> 03:07.580
As incompetent as I am...

03:08.360 --> 03:10.620
<i>A marriage with Yukichi by my side?!</i>

03:15.880 --> 03:18.680
Thank you for making my lunch box today!

03:18.680 --> 03:21.320
You even ironed my shirt for me.

03:21.320 --> 03:23.840
You're such a masterful cat!

03:28.360 --> 03:34.060
I don't mind going through with the divorce,
but I can't live without Yukichi.

03:34.060 --> 03:35.230
No way!

03:35.230 --> 03:38.980
Yukichi is <i>my</i> cat! Don't be ridiculous!

03:39.360 --> 03:43.990
Yukichi has also told me he doesn't want to 
go back to living off of your meager salary.

03:45.120 --> 03:47.930
Make sure to send that to the ward office.

03:50.530 --> 03:53.120
Yukichi! Yukichi!

03:55.530 --> 03:58.420
No marriage! I won't hand my Yukichi over!

03:58.420 --> 03:59.320
<i>Huh?</i>

03:59.320 --> 04:01.220
<i>Yukichi bills? It's about money?!</i>

04:01.220 --> 04:03.680
What a terrifying thought!

04:05.720 --> 04:08.430
So, what kind of man are you 
looking for, Yuri-chan?

04:08.430 --> 04:10.390
Me?

04:10.880 --> 04:18.280
I have a father complex, so I'd like 
a tolerant older man who'd spoil me rotten.

04:18.280 --> 04:20.530
Being rich would be a plus.

04:20.530 --> 04:24.060
I hope he'll take the lead 
with chores around the house

04:24.060 --> 04:29.030
and forgive me for being 
bad at cleaning up.

04:29.030 --> 04:32.790
Oh! It'd also be amazing if he'd make lunches for me!

04:32.790 --> 04:37.200
A kind of motherly man who'd say, 
"Make sure to eat vegetables, too."

04:37.820 --> 04:39.160
I totally get you.

04:39.160 --> 04:40.550
<i>Lunch...</i>

04:40.850 --> 04:44.770
Even though I know that kind 
of dream man doesn't exist!

04:44.770 --> 04:47.550
No, they might be more 
common than you think...

04:47.980 --> 04:48.800
Huh?!

04:48.800 --> 04:50.560
<i>I have one at home myself.</i>

04:52.120 --> 04:53.780
<i>He's a cat, though.</i>

04:53.780 --> 04:56.470
<i>Epitome of the tolerant homemaker.</i>

05:13.430 --> 05:15.020
If...

05:15.020 --> 05:17.250
Hypothetically, okay?

05:18.670 --> 05:24.050
If a person with double my salary 
came and said they wanted you...

05:25.140 --> 05:26.580
Yukichi, would you...?

05:28.340 --> 05:29.760
No hesitation?!

05:30.240 --> 05:32.720
Y-You heartless cat!

05:32.720 --> 05:36.180
Shouldn't you have wavered 
for at least three seconds?!

05:45.680 --> 05:49.320
Your ability to toss me aside so decisively 
after thinking that deeply is cruel, too!

05:49.910 --> 05:51.090
I've decided!

05:51.830 --> 05:56.000
I'm going to earn some qualifications! 
I'll increase my salary!

05:57.800 --> 05:59.200
It's time to sleep?!

05:59.200 --> 06:01.390
I'm not a growing child!

06:01.390 --> 06:04.170
There are times when an adult 
has to do what they have to do!

06:18.170 --> 06:19.980
D-Don't get me wrong!

06:19.980 --> 06:23.340
I just happen to be sleepy today!

06:23.660 --> 06:26.740
Starting tomorrow, I'm totally 
gonna pull all-nighters!

06:28.320 --> 06:30.540
<i>I was asleep in three seconds.</i>

06:41.630 --> 06:44.120
<i>Now, consider this.</i>

06:44.760 --> 06:47.570
<i>The metallic sounds that can be 
faintly heard in the darkness...</i>

06:47.900 --> 06:53.840
<i>Could they be the sound of samurai 
ghosts walking throughout the village,</i>

06:53.840 --> 06:56.510
<i>creating supernatural chaos?</i>

06:56.510 --> 07:01.680
<i>When we reviewed the video 
recording of the night before...</i>

07:03.400 --> 07:05.900
<b>Village of Samurai Ghosts</b>

07:03.400 --> 07:05.900
<b>The mysterious metallic sounds—!!</b>

07:06.860 --> 07:08.720
<i></i>Thursday Horror Special<i>.</i>

07:08.720 --> 07:10.760
<i>Be sure to catch us again next week.</i>

07:12.120 --> 07:15.240
I-It wasn't that scary.

07:18.060 --> 07:21.100
<i>What should I do?! 
That scared the crap out of me...</i>

07:21.100 --> 07:23.670
<i>Why'd I say I wanted to watch it again?!</i>

07:24.650 --> 07:26.240
What should we watch?

07:26.980 --> 07:28.930
Oh! <i>Horror Special</i>'s on?

07:29.670 --> 07:33.180
<i>No, Yukichi seemed interested, 
so I couldn't help myself!</i>

07:34.220 --> 07:39.270
Following
 unconsciously

07:36.390 --> 07:38.270
Huh? Huh?!

07:39.550 --> 07:42.900
Oh, no! It's nothing!

07:42.900 --> 07:44.420
Oh, yeah! Beer!

07:44.420 --> 07:45.940
I want a beer! A beer!

07:46.480 --> 07:48.830
<i>Maybe I won't be scared if I'm drunk!</i>

07:51.320 --> 07:53.200
<i>Your bath has been drawn.</i>

07:53.200 --> 07:54.200
No!

07:54.200 --> 07:55.740
No, no, no! Beer!

07:55.740 --> 07:57.510
I'll take a bath after a beer!

07:57.510 --> 07:59.500
I promise I won't sleep in the tub!

08:00.370 --> 08:03.020
It's no use! He has zero trust in me!

08:06.240 --> 08:08.040
I don't wanna! I don't wanna!

08:08.040 --> 08:09.480
Then, I'm not taking a bath today!

08:09.480 --> 08:12.920
I'll skip the bath, drink a beer, and sleep!

08:17.540 --> 08:18.740
Hold on.

08:18.740 --> 08:21.810
Why did you have something like this on you?

08:25.530 --> 08:26.820
<i>This is bad.</i>

08:28.040 --> 08:31.670
<i>He's treating me more 
and more like a little kid.</i>

08:31.670 --> 08:34.390
<i>If he finds out that 
I'm too scared to take a bath</i>

08:34.390 --> 08:36.240
<i>because I watched a horror show...</i>

08:36.800 --> 08:39.440
<i>I'll lose all my respect as a pet owner!</i>

08:39.970 --> 08:41.750
<i>There wasn't any to begin with.</i>

08:42.510 --> 08:44.620
<i>Who's scared of samurai ghosts?</i>

08:55.880 --> 08:57.640
Ouch!

08:55.880 --> 08:57.640
Hangers

08:55.880 --> 08:57.640
Scale

08:58.220 --> 08:59.340
<i>Bad!</i>

08:59.340 --> 09:00.870
<i>This is really bad!</i>

09:00.870 --> 09:03.260
<i>Am I so terrified that 
I'm having hallucinations?!</i>

09:03.260 --> 09:05.390
<i>I should just wash my hair and hurry out!</i>

09:07.970 --> 09:10.350
<i>Don't think about anything. Forget it all.</i>

09:10.350 --> 09:12.560
<i>Who cares about some samurai ghosts!</i>

09:12.560 --> 09:16.480
<i>What if I look up and there's 
a ghost in the mirror?!</i>

09:16.480 --> 09:17.490
<i>It's no use!</i>

09:17.490 --> 09:20.620
<i>Why do I keep thinking of horror cliches?!</i>

09:21.150 --> 09:23.600
<i>An adult shouldn't be scared 
of something like this!</i>

09:23.600 --> 09:24.470
<i>Probably!</i>

09:28.290 --> 09:31.210
<i>Planning to have her step 
on it once she comes out.</i>

09:34.920 --> 09:38.510
Yeah, it was a nice bath...

09:38.920 --> 09:42.230
Sorry for being so noisy.

09:42.230 --> 09:45.130
Anyways, I should have a beer...

09:48.260 --> 09:52.190
I've warmed up. I'm fine. I'm fine.

09:54.780 --> 09:57.780
<b>Gulp</b>

09:58.300 --> 10:00.130
So cold!

10:04.890 --> 10:08.870
L-Looks like chugging the beer 
made me a little cold?

10:09.180 --> 10:11.830
Yukichi, let's go to bed!

10:12.180 --> 10:15.130
I-I mean, it'll be warm 
if we sleep together!

10:24.770 --> 10:27.570
<i>I should stop thinking 
about it and go to bed.</i>

10:28.900 --> 10:31.180
<i>It's okay. I'm an adult.</i>

10:31.180 --> 10:34.060
<i>Three seconds is all I need to fall asleep.</i>

10:44.410 --> 10:48.370
<i>I'm an adult! I'm an adult! 
I'm an adult! I'm an adult! I'm...</i>

10:50.870 --> 10:52.260
<i>What's that sound?</i>

10:52.260 --> 10:54.590
<i>So scary! I can't sleep!</i>

10:57.720 --> 10:59.590
<i>Did Yukichi go and take a look?</i>

11:09.760 --> 11:11.560
<i>He's not coming back.</i>

11:13.860 --> 11:15.400
Yukichi?

11:19.850 --> 11:20.900
Yukichi?

11:31.920 --> 11:34.920
Wh... Wh-Wh-Wh-What're you doing?!

11:42.080 --> 11:43.280
I can't! I can't! I can't!

11:43.280 --> 11:45.680
I can't forget what I just saw!

11:46.720 --> 11:48.520
<b>Daiginjo</b>

11:49.080 --> 11:51.810
<i>He's going to make me forget!</i>

11:51.810 --> 11:55.810
Come to think of it, you did that a lot 
when you were a kitten.

11:57.210 --> 11:59.820
You could just pour some out to drink.

11:59.820 --> 12:02.820
There's no need to hide something like that.

12:02.820 --> 12:06.160
You should act more freely at home.

12:06.160 --> 12:08.830
It's important to be a little 
careful outside, though.

12:09.760 --> 12:14.330
I want you to be more 
relaxed at home, Yukichi.

12:15.780 --> 12:17.340
Oh, and...

12:17.760 --> 12:22.000
That ghost show left me terrified, but then
 you surprised all the fear right out of me.

12:22.000 --> 12:23.850
I thought I'd never fall asleep...

12:25.940 --> 12:29.010
Wait, don't get the wrong idea! 
I wasn't <i>that</i> scared of it!

12:29.010 --> 12:31.560
I know that it's all fake re-enactments!

12:32.020 --> 12:33.620
Jeez! Another cup!

12:33.620 --> 12:35.920
Make some snacks, too!

12:58.540 --> 13:00.500
Sorry, was I being loud?

13:01.010 --> 13:04.840
I was looking at something on Ista 
my work junior showed me recently.

13:05.380 --> 13:10.140
She said that looking at a cat owner's account 
makes you feel like you're taking care of a cat.

13:14.420 --> 13:15.840
No, no. That's not it!

13:15.840 --> 13:17.560
Of course you're a cat, Yukichi!

13:17.560 --> 13:18.790
You're a cat, but...

13:18.790 --> 13:20.480
Oh, that café au lait looks good!

13:20.480 --> 13:25.490
<b>Tremble</b>

13:20.830 --> 13:22.120
U-Um!

13:22.120 --> 13:25.490
The chief has been asking me 
about you lately!

13:27.390 --> 13:30.050
Y-Yes! He's doing great!

13:30.050 --> 13:33.080
<i>Someone who lives a place
 filled with trash has a cat?</i>

13:33.490 --> 13:36.000
<i>Is she taking care of it right?</i>

13:36.000 --> 13:41.210
I think he's wondering if I've been 
taking good of you, like my mom...

13:41.580 --> 13:44.700
The chief seems to like cats.

13:44.700 --> 13:48.200
That's why I'm looking 
at various cat owner accounts.

13:48.200 --> 13:50.180
I'm hoping I look a little less suspicious

13:50.180 --> 13:52.910
if I manage to make cats 
part of my daily life.

13:55.230 --> 13:56.810
Wh-What's wrong?

13:57.780 --> 13:59.680
What are you warming up for?

14:01.700 --> 14:05.610
A-Are you going to show me 
something a regular cat would do?!

14:07.590 --> 14:09.490
Y-Yukichi!

14:10.210 --> 14:14.780
Oh! That's the scratching post 
I've never seen you use!

14:15.530 --> 14:18.820
I just finished watching a clip 
of a cat that had to be rescued

14:18.820 --> 14:20.420
because its claws got stuck in one!

14:23.890 --> 14:25.480
<i>Lute-playing priest.</i>

14:27.340 --> 14:28.940
I knew it...

14:30.830 --> 14:34.680
Yeah. Well, Yukichi is Yukichi.

14:35.110 --> 14:38.470
You don't need to force 
yourself to act like a regular cat.

14:41.080 --> 14:42.520
What are you doing now?

14:43.690 --> 14:45.810
Oh! Could this be the skill

14:45.810 --> 14:48.510
where a cat walks through a bunch of items 
without knocking any over?!

14:47.190 --> 14:49.700
<i>Weave...</i>

14:49.700 --> 14:51.970
What? Can you really do it?!

14:52.700 --> 14:56.080
But your legs are bigger 
than a regular cat's!

14:56.460 --> 15:00.120
Okay! Then, give it a try!

15:00.830 --> 15:03.340
<b>Plum Pulp</b>

15:00.830 --> 15:03.340
<b>Japanese Mustard</b>

15:05.840 --> 15:12.340
<b>Tap Tap
Shf Ta-Tap Ta-Tap</b>

15:05.840 --> 15:12.340
<b>Tap Tap</b>

15:06.240 --> 15:08.040
Yeah. That's amazing...

15:08.040 --> 15:12.340
It's amazing, but it doesn't 
look cat-like at all!

15:12.800 --> 15:14.190
Wait, what is that?

15:14.190 --> 15:16.070
What even <i>is</i> a regular cat? What's normal?!

15:16.070 --> 15:17.850
I don't know anymore.

15:17.850 --> 15:22.850
<b>Cat Labyrinth</b>

15:18.190 --> 15:22.850
Could it be that regular cats 
are actually imaginary creatures?!

15:23.200 --> 15:27.860
I'm pretty sure I'm going to fail in seconds 
if the chief asks me about cats again.

15:28.310 --> 15:31.450
There's no point in looking 
at all these Ista reels.

15:32.080 --> 15:33.430
Look at...

15:39.930 --> 15:42.290
Huh?! Are you puffing out your cheeks?!

15:42.290 --> 15:43.990
Do cats have cheeks that work like that?

15:43.990 --> 15:44.870
Stop!

15:44.870 --> 15:47.980
I'm getting more and 
more confused about cats!

15:50.810 --> 15:55.300
Oh, but there's one thing I completely 
agree with other cat owners about!

15:55.670 --> 16:01.810
No matter how cute other cats are, I always 
end up thinking my cat is the cutest.

16:05.020 --> 16:08.300
Well, that's the only one though...

16:14.020 --> 16:15.570
Yay!

16:15.940 --> 16:19.660
If only I could talk about 
the delicious food my cat makes for me!

16:19.660 --> 16:22.140
I'd be able to go on and on!

16:26.290 --> 16:28.180
Shoot, shoot, shoot, shoot!

16:28.180 --> 16:29.800
I need to leave in three minutes!

16:30.220 --> 16:31.340
Sorry, Yukichi!

16:31.340 --> 16:32.760
I'm just going to take the coffee...

16:44.890 --> 16:46.520
Y-Yukichi! I'm sorry!

16:46.520 --> 16:48.390
<i>He's gonna cluck his tongue again!</i>

16:48.390 --> 16:49.270
Huh?

16:52.070 --> 16:53.030
He broke?!

16:53.030 --> 16:54.530
Sorry!

16:54.530 --> 16:56.690
I'm sorry for being so airheaded!

16:56.690 --> 17:00.040
I deeply regret my actions! P-Please!

17:01.440 --> 17:03.320
Please stay calm!

17:03.750 --> 17:05.300
He's gone mad!

17:05.300 --> 17:07.420
Wh-What are you doing?!

17:07.680 --> 17:10.150
Wait, does wallpaper 
normally come off so easily?

17:10.150 --> 17:10.890
Huh?

17:11.260 --> 17:12.920
The wallpaper is still there!

17:13.230 --> 17:15.930
There are two layers?!

17:16.960 --> 17:19.760
Did you know that something 
like this would happen one day?

17:21.930 --> 17:26.900
<b>Removable Wallpaper
 Rental Friendly</b>

17:22.420 --> 17:23.350
You're a genius!

17:23.350 --> 17:24.930
The very picture of the perfect renter!

17:24.930 --> 17:26.900
The guardian deity of security deposits!

17:27.210 --> 17:30.160
And I know that this is 
the worst timing ever!

17:30.160 --> 17:31.520
But I'm really gonna be late!

17:31.520 --> 17:32.910
I need to go! I'm so sorry!

17:33.280 --> 17:35.210
I'm heading out!

17:45.120 --> 17:46.510
<i>Apply pressure.</i>

17:49.110 --> 17:51.130
<i>Apply pressure again.</i>

17:53.200 --> 17:54.540
<i>And repeat.</i>

17:55.810 --> 17:56.990
<i>Cut away.</i>

17:59.220 --> 18:00.940
<i>Reapplication complete.</i>

18:32.430 --> 18:33.800
<i>Perfect.</i>

18:34.160 --> 18:37.100
<i>We appreciate everyone's cooperation.</i>

18:38.040 --> 18:39.860
I'm home, Yukichi!

18:39.860 --> 18:41.920
Sorry about what happened this morning!

18:41.920 --> 18:44.470
I brought a lot of cans of cat food 
home as an apology...

18:45.360 --> 18:47.000
Completely renovated?!

18:48.380 --> 18:50.900
Wh-Where'd this cabinet come from?!

18:51.920 --> 18:53.960
This door is made from wooden slats!

18:53.960 --> 18:55.800
The shelf that used to be here...

18:55.800 --> 18:57.080
You made it into something else?!

18:57.080 --> 18:58.810
Are you some kind of artisan?!

19:01.200 --> 19:03.110
He looks intoxicated!

19:03.110 --> 19:05.490
He's intoxicated with his own capabilities!

19:05.490 --> 19:07.760
Well, he really <i>is</i> talented after all.

19:11.700 --> 19:13.610
This is so nice!

19:13.610 --> 19:16.200
I feel like I'm in heaven compared 
to the hell of this morning.

19:16.200 --> 19:18.660
This doesn't even feel 
like my place anymore.

19:27.970 --> 19:31.060
Oh! Yeah, another serving!

19:31.060 --> 19:32.100
Thanks...

19:33.480 --> 19:38.470
<i>I feel like the place gets nicer 
every time I make a mess.</i>

19:38.470 --> 19:41.910
<i>But I better keep that thought 
to myself for my own safety.</i>

19:54.680 --> 19:57.670
<i>A turbulent room creates a turbulent heart.</i>

19:58.420 --> 20:01.090
<i>And so, as a masterful cat,</i>

20:02.010 --> 20:04.750
<i>daily cleaning is a must.</i>

20:04.750 --> 20:07.600
<i>Diligent decluttering is also key.</i>

20:08.130 --> 20:08.960
<i>However...</i>

20:08.960 --> 20:09.850
<i>Even so!</i>

20:10.830 --> 20:13.930
<i>If you clean and declutter to the extreme...</i>

20:13.930 --> 20:18.230
<i>Only a utilitarian room 
like a prison cell will remain.</i>

20:18.640 --> 20:20.720
<i>Only a mediocre cat would do such a thing!</i>

20:21.580 --> 20:26.500
<i>A home is a place one returns to 
for rest and recovery.</i>

20:26.810 --> 20:28.160
Home!

20:28.480 --> 20:30.830
<i>While filth is unacceptable,</i>

20:30.830 --> 20:33.920
<i>a place too minimalist will not soothe the soul.</i>

20:33.920 --> 20:39.780
<i>Especially for my worthless human, 
whose mind is made of tofu.</i>

20:34.910 --> 20:37.420
<i>Tofu brain...</i>

20:40.180 --> 20:42.420
I don't wanna go to work...

20:42.720 --> 20:46.090
<i>Healing is a crucial factor 
for her in a home.</i>

20:46.510 --> 20:48.640
<i>Without passing the threshold of chaos,</i>

20:48.640 --> 20:50.350
<i>a fine balance must be maintained.</i>

20:51.630 --> 20:54.850
<i>The lighting and interior design
must also be carefully considered.</i>

20:58.940 --> 21:01.060
<i>All carefully considered, but...</i>

21:02.400 --> 21:04.850
<i>Instead of breeding diligence,</i>

21:04.850 --> 21:08.620
<i>she seems to be accelerating 
down the path of indolence.</i>

21:10.180 --> 21:12.920
<i>Why is this the result?</i>

21:14.520 --> 21:18.630
I don't think I can ever leave here again.

21:21.280 --> 21:24.370
I should take the day off...

21:25.680 --> 21:29.600
<i>It seems her environment 
still requires improvement.</i>

21:30.120 --> 21:33.800
<i>I'll go out and take a look at some 
aromatherapy oils to try today.</i>

21:32.470 --> 21:37.060
* Aromatherapy oils are dangerous for normal cats.
